{"title":"1997 PMWC Answer Key","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>I1. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/8/da8ef5a5d22f7c49e762be223aa35820132fa5b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$837\\dfrac{1}{420}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>I2. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/b/dcb85cf28eed5ed7afd583875ecd38d071a319ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20661$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p>I3. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> p.m. Wednesday\n</p><p>I4. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I5. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/a/14adf3edee2dba9ffd0589a65ca22633de488df7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\text{ cm}^2$\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>I6. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/f/0cfe12fd47c10d4919e440b30230df5f97d24311.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textdollar 7.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I7. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I8. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/a/aaa1fc71b09af19812c2d58f881973287e7f6469.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$167$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>I9. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/a/05abdf92a8a2b951f02403cd08fb8f1c2cdb27ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7500$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>I10. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" c